Code copied or adapted from other projects is listed below with its source,
copyright and licence.

  CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md is adapted from the Contributor Covenant, version 2.1,
  https://www.contributor-covenant.org, licensed under CC BY 4.0.

  OTLP messages (all five packages). OTLP requests and responses are built
  and read with the official OpenTelemetry SDKs, OTLP exporters and protocol
  bindings of each language (opentelemetry-proto, Copyright The OpenTelemetry
  Authors, Apache-2.0): @opentelemetry/exporter-*-otlp-proto, -otlp-http,
  -otlp-grpc, @opentelemetry/otlp-transformer and @grpc/grpc-js (Apache-2.0)
  for TypeScript; opentelemetry-otlp, opentelemetry-proto and tonic (MIT) for
  Rust; go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp and go.opentelemetry.io/proto/otlp
  for Go; opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-http (and the optional -proto-grpc)
  and opentelemetry-proto for Python; io.opentelemetry:opentelemetry-exporter-otlp
  for Java. All five packages decode the google.rpc.Status error bodies of the
  collector (and TypeScript, Rust and Java also OTLP partial-success
  responses) with a small hand-written reader that uses the field numbers of
  opentelemetry-proto and of the Google APIs common protos
  (google/rpc/status.proto, Copyright Google LLC, Apache-2.0). No .proto files
  or generated code from these projects are copied into this repository.

  Test fixtures (typescript/test/fixtures, go/testdata/fixtures,
  python/tests/fixtures, java/src/test/resources/fixtures) contain responses
  recorded from the OpenTelemetry Collector Contrib 0.165.0 container (zpages
  and health_check pages, internal telemetry, OTLP responses) and from the
  Jaeger 2.23.0 query API. OpenTelemetry Collector:
  Copyright The OpenTelemetry Authors,
  https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector-contrib, Apache-2.0.
  Jaeger: Copyright The Jaeger Authors, https://github.com/jaegertracing/jaeger,
  Apache-2.0.

  docker/config/stock-config.reference.yaml is a copy of the default
  configuration shipped in the otel/opentelemetry-collector-contrib image
  (Copyright The OpenTelemetry Authors, Apache-2.0); docker/config/collector.yaml
  is derived from it. The container images used by the Docker test harness
  (otel/opentelemetry-collector-contrib, jaegertracing/jaeger, busybox,
  curlimages/curl) are used for testing only and are not part of any
  published package.
